      "year": 2019,
      "abstract": "The recent research results in finite-time and cooperative flight vehicle control is introduced in this chapter. Finite-time and cooperative control of flight vehicle, including aircraft, spacecraft, rocket, and missile, has been a very active research topic in the systems and controls society. The recent research results in finite-time and cooperative control of flight vehicle are roughly categorized as finite-time attitude stabilization, finite-time attitude tracking, finite-time attitude synchronization, finite-time formation flying, etc.",
